# Phone messages
@scenario tutorial_lesson_22
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: I've left you a message. My name is the part you read. The chat uses my ID to work out who sent it.
ginger: Open the sample conversation. Its contacts and display names are in config/phone/phone.properties.
> Open the sample chat -> messages
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label messages
[phone contact ginger name="Ginger"]
[phone thread example title="Example chat" participants=player,ginger]
[if !tutorial_message_sent]
[phone message example ginger "This is a sample message from Ginger." time=17:10]
[flag tutorial_message_sent]
[endif]
[phone open chat example]
ginger: Use the back control to close the chat and return to this lesson.
[phone close]
@label check
ginger: Which identifier should incoming messages target?
> Whatever title is currently displayed. -> retry
> The stable chat ID. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The ID routes the message even after the title is translated. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: The ID routes the message even after the title is translated.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_22]
[flag tutorial_done_22]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_4]
